            "block_content": "The parties have agreed to establish a Health and Welfare Fund under an Agreement and Declaration of Trust executed by MOSES and the Employer. Such Agreement and Declaration of Trust provides for a Board of Trustees composed of an equal number of representatives of the Employer and MOSES.",
